Husebo Oygard","name":"Husebo Oygard, Sigrid","rank":15,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Michael","key":"bachmannnielsenpa2","last":"Bachmann Nielsen","name":"Bachmann Nielsen, Michael","rank":16,"rolecode":"pa2"},{"affno":"","first":"Lasse Thumann","key":"jorgensenpau","last":"Jorgensen","name":"Jorgensen, Lasse Thumann","rank":16,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1109/ultsym.2019.8926210","eisbn":["9781728145969"],"issn":["19485719"],"pages":"1041-1050","publisher":"IEEE","series":"IEEE International Ultrasonics Symposium, IUS","status":"p","title":"2019 IEEE International Ultrasonics Symposium, IUS 2019"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85077517775"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Private Research","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-PR","DI-PR-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Other Companies","Private Research","Technical University of Denmark","Universities","University of Copenhagen","bk medical aps"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-e2e414f9-5c0a-4dee-822d-1cb1004f4f80","ku-7ceda842-46bc-44ad-9810-967f72523ba4"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark","KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"History and Latest Advances in Flow Estimation Technology: From 1-D in 2-D to 3-D in 4-D","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-082.16-037667","year":"2019","yearsub":"2019"}
{"abstract":"Current 2-D Super Resolution (SR) imaging is limited by the slice thickness determined by the elevation focus. The fixed, geometric elevation focus is often poor due to its high F-number. SR images are, thus, a summation of vessels across the elevation plane without the possibility to track scatterers in 3-D for full visualization. 3-D SR imaging has been obtained by translating the probe, but this does not remove the elevation summation. Full 3-D can be acquired using 2-D matrix probes, but the equipment is expensive, and the amount of data is excessive, when channel data are acquired over thousands of elements for minutes. This paper demonstrates that full volumetric SRI can be attained using a 62+62 channels Row-Column (RC) probe with a high frame rate and with µm precision. Data were acquired by a 3 MHz 62+62 PZT RC probe with λ/2 pitch connected to the SARUS scanner. A synthetic aperture scan sequence with 32 positive and 32 negative emissions was employed for pulse inversion (PI) imaging with an MI of 0.3. The pulse repetition frequency was 10 kHz for a 156 Hz volume rate. A PEGDA 700 g/mol based hydrogel flow-microphantom was 3-D printed by stereo-lithography. It contains a single cylindrical 200 µm diameter channel placed 3 mm from the top surface of the phantom. After a 5.8 mm long inlet, the channel bends 90º into a 7 mm long central region before bending 90º again into the 5.8 mm outlet. The flow channel was infused at 1.61 µL/s with Sonovue (Bracco) in a 1:10 dilution. The received RF signals from the 62 row elements were beamformed with PI to yield a full volume of 15 x 15 x 15 mm3 . The interpolated 3-D positions of the bubbles were estimated after local maximum detection. The reconstructed 3-D SR volume clearly shows the 200 µm channel shape with a high resolution in all three dimensions. The center line for the channel was found by fitting a line to all bubble positions, and their radial position calculated. The observed fraction of bubbles falling outside the channel was used for estimating the location precision. The precision was 16.5 µm in the y − z plane and 23.0 µm in the x − z plane. The point spread function had a size of 0.58 x 1.05 x 0.31 mm3 , so the interrogated volume was 15,700 times smaller than for normal volumetric B-mode imaging. This demonstrates that full 3-D SRI can be attained with just 62 receive channels. The SA sequence has a low MI, but attains a large measured penetration depth of 14 cm in a tissue mimicking phantom, due to the large RC probe size. The 156 Hz volume rate also makes it possible to track high velocities in 3-D in the volume.","author_count":10,"contributors":["Jensen, Jørgen Arendt","Schou, Mikkel","Ommen, Martin Lind","Øygard, Sigrid Husebø","Sams, Thomas","Stuart, Matthias Bo","Thomsen, Erik Vilain","Larsen, Niels Bent","Beers, Christopher","Tomov, Borislav Gueorguiev"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-381211"],"event":{"end":"2019-10-09","place":"Glasgow, gb","start":"2019-10-06","title":"2019 IEEE International Ultrasonics Symposium","year":"2019"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-OTH"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-OTH","DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"000000000003 d super resolution imaging using a 000000000062 000000000062 elements row column array","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/193805054/3D_sri_ver_2.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-381211","identifier":[{"id":"85077569361","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-ffee3c04-4cb5-459b-86c3-885974bbd664"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-F9344FBF5E70E2E998A2FE45E93F7BA3"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/193805054/3D_sri_ver_2.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Health Technology","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Health Technology, Biomedical Engineering","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Health Technology, Biomedical Engineering, Center for Fast Ultrasound Imaging"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"other companies","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Private Research","l3":"DI-PR-OTH","l3nl":"Other Companies","l3nn":"Other Companies","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Other Companies","namevar":["BK Medical ApS"],"nora_code":"DI-PR-OTH","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jørgen Arendt","key":"jensenpau","last":"Jensen","locid":"e197c9fc-743f-4736-8d06-3825897e0989","name":"Jensen, Jørgen Arendt","orcid":"0000-0002-7896-3136","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Mikkel","key":"schoupau","last":"Schou","locid":"02abcc96-628c-467d-9117-1d3a80866a55","name":"Schou, Mikkel","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Martin Lind","key":"ommenpau","last":"Ommen","locid":"e7aebb26-b70d-4857-8c80-0040af9b6102","name":"Ommen, Martin Lind","orcid":"0000-0001-9206-6426","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Sigrid Husebø","key":"øygardpau","last":"Øygard","locid":"91316990-5af9-4a30-8cfc-d293dc4bd2e5","name":"Øygard, Sigrid Husebø","orcid":"0000-0002-3021-7812","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Thomas","key":"samspau","last":"Sams","locid":"7237ce61-d883-44f0-b4a8-5c83749f6d51","name":"Sams, Thomas","orcid":"0000-0002-6316-2539","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Matthias Bo","key":"stuartpau","last":"Stuart","locid":"38dcc60f-13b3-4e3c-9561-93e13906ad24","name":"Stuart, Matthias Bo","orcid":"0000-0003-0809-530X","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Erik Vilain","key":"thomsenpau","last":"Thomsen","locid":"822fe159-0932-4e5e-aeb6-b8b7f8421ab0","name":"Thomsen, Erik Vilain","orcid":"0000-0002-2772-926X","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Niels Bent","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"7a727b09-e209-47ab-80f7-9df731c2178f","name":"Larsen, Niels Bent","orcid":"0000-0001-6506-3991","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Christopher","key":"beerspau","last":"Beers","name":"Beers, Christopher","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Borislav Gueorguiev","key":"tomovpau","last":"Tomov","locid":"16c6d791-3a1a-47ad-a725-2da30c420dee","name":"Tomov, Borislav Gueorguiev","orcid":"0000-0003-4236-3056","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1109/ultsym.2019.8926092","eisbn":["9781728145969"],"pages":"1838-1841","publisher":"IEEE","status":"p","title":"Proceedings of 2019 IEEE International Ultrasonics Symposium"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85077569361"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Private Research","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-PR-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Other Companies","Private Research","Technical University of Denmark","Universities","bk medical aps"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-ffee3c04-4cb5-459b-86c3-885974bbd664"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"3-D Super Resolution Imaging using a 62+62 Elements Row-Column Array","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-381211","year":"2019","yearsub":"2019"}
{"abstract":"Det veterinære beredskab omfatter aktiviteter, der forebygger udbrud og videresmitte af en række smitsomme sygdomme, samt aktiviteter knyttet til håndtering af udbrud. Hertil kommer markedsføringen af beredskabet i udlandet. De årlige forebyggende omkostninger ved det veterinære beredskab for mund- og klovesyge samt svinepest ligger på ca. 240 millioner kroner. Tilsvarende er et middelstort udbrud af mund- og klovesyge i Danmark beregnet at koste i størrelsesordenen 8 milliarder kroner, hvoraf langt den største del af omkostningerne skyldes tabte eksportindtægter. På den baggrund er det formålet at få belyst vigtigheden af det veterinære beredskab og markedsføringen heraf for henholdsvis adgang til eksportmarkeder (inden for og uden for EU), og for genetablering af markedsadgang efter et udbrud af mund- og klovesyge (MKS). Baseret på interviews m.m. med en række nøglepersoner belyses emnet. Konklusionerne er blandt andet, at det vurderes, at et forbedret dansk veterinært beredskab ikke vil give hurtigere markedsadgang eller adgang til flere markeder, men at et reduceret dansk veterinært beredskab potentielt vil kunne påvirke markedsadgang negativt. Ligeledes vurderes det, at øget markedsføring af det veterinære beredskab vil kunne give hurtigere markedsadgang og adgang til flere markeder.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Hansen, Henning Otte","Christensen, Tove","Denver, Sigrid","Lind, Kim Martin Hjorth"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-494216"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"hvor vigtigt er det danske veterinære beredskab","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-494216","ids":["ku-a8b3c777-0ed4-4947-bea9-f77c24e28218"],"l